# 🚀 Day 47 – Content Intelligence Studio

> **AI-Powered Content Analysis & Optimization Platform built with Claude AI**

## 📌 Overview

**Content Intelligence Studio** is a premium AI-powered content consultant that analyzes both **text and visual content** using **Claude AI**. The application simulates a professional content review process by employing multiple specialized AI reviewers that provide contextual feedback, platform-specific recommendations, and actionable improvements.

Unlike traditional rule-based analyzers, every insight, recommendation, score, and explanation is generated through **live AI reasoning**, making the review process more intelligent and personalized.

