## 🧠 AI Review Workflow

The application automatically creates a multi-stage review pipeline with specialized AI reviewers.

```
Content Upload
       │
       ▼
Interview & Context Collection
       │
       ▼
Content Strategist
       │
       ▼
Platform Specialist
       │
       ▼
Engagement Analyst
       │
       ▼
Visual Reviewer (Images)
       │
       ▼
Growth Advisor
       │
       ▼
Rewrite Generator
       │
       ▼
Publishing Checklist
       │
       ▼
Executive Summary
```

